    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DESTRUCTION IS UPON US</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WORLD EATER</strong>\u00a0is a bossfight game about an underpaid astronaut fighting a giant worm in space. You are a regular crystal mining employee for<i> the company</i>, who has tasked you with a seamingly easy endeavor. One of their worms has discovered a magical resource called<strong> space dust</strong>, which has some interesting side effects.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set out on a mission that is most definitely not stated in your contract and defeat the world eating worm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show em' how it's done. Run, fly, dodge and smack your way through this epic space bossfight against the colossal, solar system eating worm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the vast, beautiful space environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, fly and dodge on interesting and ever-changing planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through several environments while the<strong> WORLD EATER</strong>\u00a0tries to stop you</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT'S NEXT?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are a small team of 4 developers who have been working at improving the current state of the game. We are planning on creating a lot more content with new and interesting mechanics and environments. We hope you join us in our journey in making our student project a full-fledged game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DESTRUCTION IS UPON US</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WORLD EATER</strong>\u00a0is a bossfight game about an underpaid astronaut fighting a giant worm in space. You are a regular crystal mining employee for<i> the company</i>, who has tasked you with a seamingly easy endeavor. One of their worms has discovered a magical resource called<strong> space dust</strong>, which has some interesting side effects.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set out on a mission that is most definitely not stated in your contract and defeat the world eating worm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show em' how it's done. Run, fly, dodge and smack your way through this epic space bossfight against the colossal, solar system eating worm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the vast, beautiful space environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, fly and dodge on interesting and ever-changing planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through several environments while the<strong> WORLD EATER</strong>\u00a0tries to stop you</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT'S NEXT?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are a small team of 4 developers who have been working at improving the current state of the game. We are planning on creating a lot more content with new and interesting mechanics and environments. We hope you join us in our journey in making our student project a full-fledged game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
